abstract: "AsiBackbone 3.2.1 is a backward-compatible patch release for the stable 3.2.x line marking the transfer of the canonical project repository from the cdcavell GitHub namespace to the dedicated AsiBackbone organization. The release updates repository, documentation, Source Link, citation, SBOM, validation, and package metadata while preserving existing package IDs, public namespaces, runtime behavior, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 3.0.0.0."
